    "created_at": "2019-11-30T15:23:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-11-30T15:23:15Z",
    "body": "This is indeed the name of the current Kubernetes context, you can change it by running:\r\n\r\n`kubectl config rename-context <old-name> <new-name>`\r\n\r\nImho this is not something that should be facilitated by the prompt.",
